d keep going until the work is done.\n\nKeep the workspace clean. Leave intentional changes but remove any temporary files or scripts you created before finishing.","composition":{"schema":1,"contentChars":1914},"forcedRole":true,"messageId":"79688ea5-38a6-4873-998b-a13c2248aa9e"}}
